\v 21 \add As they walked out of the city,\add* they \add came across\add* a¦36241 man¦36241 coming¦36247 in from¦36248 the¦36250 country¦36250. \add He was\add* Simon¦36243 from Kurene \add (Cyrene\add*—the¦36251 father¦36252 of¦36253 Alexander¦36253 and¦36254 Rufus¦36255), and \add the soldiers\add* forced¦36239 him to carry¦36257 the¦36258 execution post,\x + \xo 15:21: \xt Rom 16:13.\x*
