\v 41 and others who¦36603 had followed¦36610 \add @Yeshua\add* around Galilee¦36609 and¦36613 \add ≈helped look after¦36612\add* him¦36616, along with many¦36620 others¦36619 who had¦36622 come¦36622 \add ≈down\add* to Yerushalem¦36625 with him.
