\v 42 As evening¦36628 came, it¦36632 was¦36632 \add now\add* the¦36633 Preparation¦36633 Day¦36633, i.e., the¦36636 \add ≈day¦36636 before¦36636\add* the Rest¦36636 Day¦36636.
